WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:00.900
Hi, I'm Matt.

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.690
And I'm Tom.

00:00:01.690 --> 00:00:02.900
And this is the Webcycle.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.220
The faster you pedal, the faster your internet goes.

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:07.540
If you just want to, say, read some text,

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:11.300
pedal very slowly and it'll still work fine.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:12.740
See, that's loading.

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:16.180
Start a YouTube video... that's...

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:17.160
Go on, pedal, Tom.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:19.290
That's going to need some effort there --

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:20.680
That's definitely going to need some effort --

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:22.360
You've nearly got it.

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:24.860
Yes! There we go!

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:26.860
I can't believe I'm pedalling this fast to listen to Rick Astley.

